<chapter xml:id="ch-analytic-methods" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Analytic Methods</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter introduces analytic methods for working with distributions,
      including normal probability plots, the central limit theorem, and
      analytic methods for hypothesis testing and confidence intervals.
    </p>
  </introduction>

